tml_url":"https://github.com/emilk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"mentioned","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2023-03-23T18:36:06Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":8831077860,"node_id":"SE_lADOCd2s285ePnzLzwAAAAIOX43k","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/emilk/egui/issues/events/8831077860","actor":{"login":"emilk","id":1148717,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDg3MTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1148717?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilk","html_url":"https://github.com/emilk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2023-03-23T18:36:06Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/emilk/egui/issues/comments/1488932556","html_url":"https://github.com/emilk/egui/issues/2720#issuecomment-1488932556","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/emilk/egui/issues/2720","id":1488932556,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCd2s285Yv07M","user":{"login":"rib","id":235361,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNTM2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/235361?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib","html_url":"https://github.com/rib","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-03-29T16:34:11Z","updated_at":"2023-03-29T16:35:12Z","body":"> I guess we need to make the activity type a feature flag of egui-winit, though I am not a big fan of that abstraction leak\r\n\r\nYeah, it's awkward but Cargo doesn't really give us many options in this case.\r\n\r\nCargo doesn't give a way to provide some kind of global feature that would allow an application crate to choose a backend feature for an indirect dependency and so we have to plumb the features for configuring the backend through Winit and any middleware frameworks like egui.\r\n\r\nIt's relatively likely that Android applications will need to implement a subclass of `Activity` in Java or Kotlin and they will have to choose to subclass `NativeActivity` or `GameActivity`. Since there are significant pros and cons to each one it wouldn't really be appropriate for Egui to force a choice here.\r\n\r\nThe other fiddly detail we have to consider here is that it's only possible to link a single version of the `android-activity` crate into an application - which isn't the case for most Rust crates.\r\n\r\nandroid-activity provides the `android_main()` entry point for an Android application and effectively provides a minimal runtime for the application. There would be a linker failure if you try to link multiple versions.\r\n\r\n_(Prior to android-activity we had the same constraint with ndk-glue except it would only manifest as a failure at runtime)_\r\n\r\nWith this constraint then we _really_ want to keep the number of crates that have any direct dependency on the `android-activity` crate to a bare minimum, to reduce any chance of a conflict in the future if there will need to be a semver bump for `android-activity`. (If there is a semver bump for `android-activity` then that should ideally only need to be synchronized with Winit and not also with crates like Egui or every single Android application crate.)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/emilk/egui/issues/comments/1488932556/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"rib","id":235361,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNTM2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/235361?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib","html_url":"https://github.com/rib","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":8878752531,"node_id":"REFE_lADOCd2s285ePnzLzwAAAAIRNwMT","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/emilk/egui/issues/events/8878752531","actor":{"login":"rib","id":235361,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNTM2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/235361?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib","html_url":"https://github.com/rib","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"referenced","commit_id":"d9cef9f2a574b33d4637d8df2198d554af6fc632","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rib/egui/commits/d9cef9f2a574b33d4637d8df2198d554af6fc632","created_at":"2023-03-29T16:56:12Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":8903777722,"node_id":"REFE_lADOCd2s285ePnzLzwAAAAIStN26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/emilk/egui/issues/events/8903777722","actor":{"login":"rib","id":235361,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNTM2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/235361?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib","html_url":"https://github.com/rib","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rib/following{/other_user}",